          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda bweyabona nga Yakobo ayenda inho Rakeli okusinga Leeya, yaagha Leeya okuzaala, aye Rakeli yaasigala nga mugumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leeya yaatoola enda, yazaala omwana mulenzi, yaamutuuma eriina Reubeni, kuba yakoba ati: “Musengwa Katonda aboine okudaazibwadaazibwa kwange, mpegaano baze aidha kuunhenda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabiri yaatoola enda, yaazaala omwana mulenzi, yaakoba ati: “Musengwa Katonda yawulira nga tyendebwa kyaviire era n'ampa omwana ono.” Kale yaamutuuma eriina Simeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era yaatoola enda, yaazaala omwana mulenzi, yaakoba ati: “Ku mukuzi guno baze aidha kugumira ku nze, kuba mmuzaaliire abaana abalenzi basatu.” Kyeyava n'amutuuma eriina Levi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era yaatoola enda kabiri yaazaala omwana mulenzi. Yaakoba ati: “Ku mukuzi guno ndidha kusaaka Musengwa Katonda.” Kyeyava n'amutuuma eriina Yuda. Agho yaakoma okuzaala.",
